+# The closures are created here, outside any specialization on the chunks: each
+# compiles for its captured chunk tuple at creation, and the body's type is one
+# type for every topology. Creation compiles every arity at once, so a body
+# compiles only the walks the loop runs: a body with no gated entry walks its
